# Project Two: Big Data Tools and Emerging Technologies

This project explores how organizations use big data technologies and emerging tools to analyze information, improve business decisions, and enhance customer experiences.

I examined Apache Spark, Hadoop, and NoSQL databases, including how these technologies work alongside traditional data management tools. I also explored how the Internet of Things (IoT), artificial intelligence, and machine learning can help organizations collect and use data more effectively.

The project discusses cybersecurity, data privacy, anonymization, and the importance of using AI responsibly in business environments.

**Skills demonstrated:** Big data analytics, emerging technologies, database concepts, AI and machine learning, cybersecurity awareness, and technical research.
